    "long_instructions": "#### A computer system is a set of parts that work together to process information and complete tasks. Simply put, it includes:\r\n\r\n>- #### **Hardware** - the physical parts\r\n>- #### **Software** - the programs that run on it\r\n>- #### **Operating System** - manages the hardware and software\r\n\r\n## 📝 To Do\r\n\r\n#### This video gives a brief overview of computer systems. While you watch this video <i>consider how the different parts of a computer system — **hardware, software, and the operating system** — work together</i>."
